    "actClause": "AN ACT to amend the tax law, in relation to extending the authority of the county of Suffolk to impose an additional one percent of sales and compensating use tax",
    "basePrintNo": "S5003",
    "basePrintNoStr": "S5003-2013",
    "coSponsors": {
